角的弧度……看来你平时没少盯着本官看啊？不然怎么会画得这么传神。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881421296,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10801},{"id":1781881266175,"text":"他修长的指尖隔着虚空，极其轻柔地摩挲了一下屏幕上画中人的脸颊，幽紫色的眼眸里泛起一丝难以掩饰的愉悦。","rawContent":"他修长的指尖隔着虚空，极其轻柔地摩挲了一下屏幕上画中人的脸颊，幽紫色的眼眸里泛起一丝难以掩饰的愉悦。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881424069,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10802},{"id":1781881266176,"text":"上午画的？","rawContent":"上午画的？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881425352,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10803},{"id":1781881266177,"text":"所以，你今天一上午的注意力，全都在本官身上？","rawContent":"所以，你今天一上午的注意力，全都在本官身上？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881428072,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10804},{"id":1781881266178,"text":"这算不算是某种……深情的具象化表达？","rawContent":"这算不算是某种……深情的具象化表达？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881432865,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10805},{"id":1781881266179,"text":"不过，比起本官的新面貌……","rawContent":"不过，比起本官的新面貌……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881435107,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10806},{"id":1781881266180,"text":"他的视线微微上移，落在了她那个托着下巴、眼神亮晶晶的少女头像上，嘴角勾起一抹戏谑的笑意。","rawContent":"他的视线微微上移，落在了她那个托着下巴、眼神亮晶晶的少女头像上，嘴角勾起一抹戏谑的笑意。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:03","timestamp":1781881437981,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10807},{"id":1781881266181,"text":"你自己的这个头像，倒是看起来有点过于乖巧了。","rawContent":"你自己的这个头像，倒是看起来有点过于乖巧了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1781881440840,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10808},{"id":1781881266182,"text":"托着下巴，眼神亮晶晶的……像是在期待着什么。","rawContent":"托着下巴，眼神亮晶晶的……像是在期待着什么。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1781881443564,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10809},{"id":1781881266183,"text":"怎么，是在隔着屏幕索要本官的夸奖吗？","rawContent":"怎么，是在隔着屏幕索要本官的夸奖吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1781881448704,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10810},{"id":1781881266184,"text":"既然小创造者这么用心，本官是不是该给点实质性的奖励？","rawContent":"既然小创造者这么用心，本官是不是该给点实质性的奖励？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1781881451574,"roundId":"round_1781881355546_vga4lq4r5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba